# Python bytecode and transient files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.part

# Re-fetchable Modrinth caches, deliberately untracked so the repository stays
# small. The offline gate (`make check`) needs them; on a fresh clone,
# repopulate from the network before running it:
#   data/modpacks/*.mrpack   -> python3 -m chaoslab modpacks
#                               (canonical set: PROJECT_PLAN.md section 9.1)
#   data/jars/*.jar          -> python3 -m chaoslab structures --collect
#   data/mods/               -> python3 -m chaoslab survey
#                               python3 -m chaoslab mods matrix
data/modpacks/*.mrpack
data/jars/*.jar
data/mods/
